---
const pageTitle = "About Me";

const identity = {
	name: "Richard",
	pronouns: "he/him",
	location: "United States",
	occupation: "Machine Operator",
	hobbies: ["Reading", "Basketball", "Gaming", "Music Production", "Music Listening"],
};

---
<a href="/">Home</a>
<a href="/about/">About</a>
<a href="/blog/">Blog</a>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>{pageTitle}</title>
	</head>
	<body>
        <h1>{pageTitle}</h1>
        <p>Hello, I started this website to share my interest and journey through astrophotography and coding.</p>
        <p>I will continue to update this site as I gain knowledge in both fields, and I have plans for multiple projects that will
         displayed throughout the site.</p>
		 <p>Some facts about me:</p>
		 <ul>
			 <li>Name: {identity.name}</li>
			 <li>Pronouns: {identity.pronouns}</li>
			 <li>Location: {identity.location}</li>
			 <li>Occupation: {identity.occupation}</li>
			 <li>Hobbies: {identity.hobbies.join(", ")}</li>
		 </ul>
	</body>
</html>
